# Frontend (React / TS)

Read `.kiro/steering/tech.md` and `.kiro/steering/product.md` when UX matters.

- Vite + React + TypeScript + Tailwind. State: Zustand. Playback: hls.js via `frontend/src/playback.ts`.
- API calls through same-origin `:8090` — no raw service ports in client config.
- **Symbol lookup:** codegraph MCP for component/hook symbols — not full-tree Repomix dumps.
- Build check: `cd frontend && npm run build` or `make frontend-test`.
- Pulse extension UI lives in sibling **streamclone-pulse** — shared types in `packages/pulse-core/`.

Do not compute Pulse scores client-side; use backend peaks/coverage payloads.
